WhaleLink
=========

This project is inspired by TerraBlind (https://github.com/Reisenbug/TerraBlind),
an MIT-licensed tModLoader mod that lets an LLM agent play Terraria.

No TerraBlind source code is included in this repository. The input-injection
approach (writing Player.control* flags in ModPlayer.SetControls) and the general
"LLM plans / code reflexes / mod executes" split are ideas borrowed from it and
from the tModLoader modding community.
